msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ingestedAt is functional"
msgstr "ingestedAt 具有函数性"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:ingestedAt is functional: a gmeow:ImportActivity has a single transaction time — the one instant it recorded its claims into the system — so exactly one xsd:dateTime stamps the activity, keeping the ingest axis distinct from assertion and validity."
msgstr "在规范载体上断言 gmeow:ingestedAt 是函数性的:一个 gmeow:ImportActivity 恰好有一个单一的事务时间——它将其主张记录进系统的那一时刻——因此恰好有一个 xsd:dateTime 为该活动打上时间戳,使摄入轴与断言轴、有效性轴保持区分。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:ingestedAt names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."
msgstr "当原生一致性门必须强制 gmeow:ingestedAt 恰好命名一个值 时使用；该记录是门所连接的规范载体，因此该义务是被推理出来的，而非在形状表面上重述。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid this record when a second value would make the record ambiguous — retire the assertion instead of weakening it, and never mirror it as a hand-authored shape."
msgstr "当第二个值会使该记录产生歧义时避免使用该记录——应撤回该断言而非削弱它，且绝不将其复刻为手写形状。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:ingestedAtFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt ."
msgstr "gmeow:ingestedAtFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:ingestedAt ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/ingestedAtFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:ingestedAt and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:ingestedAt (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:ingestedAt 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:ingestedAt 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"
